OL,3,ADenmark accuses Russia of plotting to
OL,4,Aassassinate US-Ukrainian rapper
OL,5,
OL,6,FDenmark has accused Russian
OL,7,Fintelligence services of plotting to
OL,8,Fassassinate a Ukrainian-American near
OL,9,FCopenhagen, saying they had "planned"
OL,10,Fand "initiated" the attempt.
OL,12,FDenmark's security and intelligence
OL,13,Fagency (PET) said it had stopped
OL,14,Findividuals who were intending to kill
OL,15,Fthe person, named by Danish media as
OL,16,Frapper Kyivstoner, at a concert in
OL,17,FSeptember. Two people were charged with
OL,18,Fattempted murder and assisting a
OL,19,Fforeign intelligence service, and
OL,20,Fpleaded not guilty.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
